/*
  ReauthDialog.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal/dialog · 0007 · ReauthDialog (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  ReauthDialog resolves (table "ReauthDialog") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (components/feedback/ReauthDialog.tsx). The remainder backs the native state
  envelope (loading, empty, error retry, freshness chip, connectivity banner) and
  the VoiceOver builders. `{{token}}` is the i18next placeholder the projection
  substitutes with the confirmation token (CONFIRM).
*/

